\
Cross-platform execution increases confidence.\
\
---\
\
# CI-020\
\
## Rule\
\
Treat CI configuration as production code.\
\
CI files require:\
\
- Code Review\
- Version Control\
- Documentation\
- Testing\
\
Pipeline definitions are part of the automation framework.\
